# CPython (TASK-27 9c, proposed ADR-0320; `make test-python`, which turns
# @TLS...@ ports into numbers): a static python3 from the volume's /bin with
# its standard library in /usr/lib/python3.15, a POSIX program run through
# the broker. The disk's /system/tls/roots is the test PKI's root; the names
# come from net.hosts; the programs are tests/python/*.py in the volume's root.
